https://looksmax.org/threads/jeremy-fragrance-brutal-agepill.401006/"},{"title":"rate jeremy fragrance","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-jeremy-fragrance.30620/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220805184745/https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-jeremy-fragrance.30620/"},{"title":"rate jeremy fragrance","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-jeremy-fragrance.6055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230209055942/https://looksmax.org/threads/rate-jeremy-fragrance.6055/"}],"news":[],"social":[{"title":"Scents in brands of body wash, chicken stock and canned drink come from Givaudan","url":"https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=13938887","site":"Hacker News","score":53,"comments":23,"year":2017}],"web":[{"title":"Perfume - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfume"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Style & presentation","chain":["Matched wash, lotion and fragrance","Scent builds in layers","Longer-lasting, more distinct scent"],"effect":"direct","text":"Users stack matching body wash, lotion and fragrance so their scent builds in layers and lasts longer through the day. The fragrance industry promotes versions of the practice."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Scent layering is the practice of using matching or complementary scented products, such as body wash, lotion and fragrance, in sequence so the smell builds and lasts longer. The fragrance industry promotes a version of it: scented bath oil, shower gel or lotion in the morning, a lighter eau de toilette in the afternoon, and perfume at pulse points in the evening.[1]","No published trials of layering were found. General references say hydrated skin holds fragrance longer and that diet, medications and dry skin can alter how a scent develops.[1]"],"infobox":[["Type","Fragrance technique"],["Products","Body wash, lotion, fragrance"],["Aim","Longer-lasting, cohesive scent"],["Cost","Varies"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Typical longevity is described as about 2 hours for cologne, 2 to 4 for eau de toilette and up to 6 to 8 for perfume, and concentration labels are imprecise between brands.[1] Layering within one scent family is described by proponents as a way to extend these times."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Safety","paras":["Natural and synthetic perfume materials can include allergenic compounds, and a long history of use does not by itself establish safety.[1] Stacking several scented products increases the number of fragrance ingredients in contact with skin."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found."],"subs":[]}],"lore":{"intro":"Layering is discussed as a way to make a scent last and read as intentional.","claims":[{"claim":"Matching body wash, lotion and fragrance makes scent last longer","verdict":"unknown","note":""}]},"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Perfume","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perfume","source":"Wikipedia","year":2024,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"fragrance","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance.1717718/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260103074820/https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance.1717718/"},{"title":"Fragrance recommendations?","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance-recommendations.1707278/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228162506/https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance-recommendations.1707278/"},{"title":"Looksmax Fragrance Blending and SyrianPsychos INSANE RESULTS","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance-blending-and-syrianpsychos-insane-results.957179/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240227131200/https://looksmax.org/threads/fragrance-blending-and-syrianpsychos-insane-results.957179/"},{"title":"this fragrance is the goat","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/this-fragrance-is-the-goat.1789260/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228041616/https: